[{:db/id "q-36333/selection/65291cd5892c708e6a9a13e2ee021a01c33618da7ca40defe542430d546423af" :answer/id #uuid "0c0c6d5f-6d9e-52e6-acc9-464efb8c0b2b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x+2y-6z=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-36333/selection/eddd1c757c3aa4df7de504c9c8198158e8bbc76714e1e31d7e9e074f1e513e58" :answer/id #uuid "a9c1e050-76b2-549f-96c1-e63e3cedd4f7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2x-y-3z=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-36333/selection/1e53749cbe7ddc499f4d788f50c211c95462c480840bc3cb4d07d04627c6adae" :answer/id #uuid "521b4ef9-83fc-5afc-9832-b04b347bcaad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x-2y+3z-15=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-36333/selection/85b9c37dba483a03ffbb8ea03c12f2890e08aa5970878ae80735e69e159e06b0" :answer/id #uuid "2a0f90f9-5f51-5988-8f9b-bac7e0c828a6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x+2y-6z+14=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-36333/selection/8c47bade86800ab764e55197b8802adc3ba96032dfc3dabadffd987d8b94b094" :answer/id #uuid "e6de21cd-ac0e-5a2b-8d4f-355f4ded8520" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x-y-3z+5=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-36333/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "232c9209-611a-5268-81c2-680df1844764" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-36333/selection/eddd1c757c3aa4df7de504c9c8198158e8bbc76714e1e31d7e9e074f1e513e58" :answer-field/choices ["q-36333/selection/65291cd5892c708e6a9a13e2ee021a01c33618da7ca40defe542430d546423af" "q-36333/selection/eddd1c757c3aa4df7de504c9c8198158e8bbc76714e1e31d7e9e074f1e513e58" "q-36333/selection/1e53749cbe7ddc499f4d788f50c211c95462c480840bc3cb4d07d04627c6adae" "q-36333/selection/85b9c37dba483a03ffbb8ea03c12f2890e08aa5970878ae80735e69e159e06b0" "q-36333/selection/8c47bade86800ab764e55197b8802adc3ba96032dfc3dabadffd987d8b94b094"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-36333" :question/id #uuid "4b44e3a8-06c2-5738-ab1f-01ab1bad733b" :question/math-academy-id "q-36333" :question/problem "Given the function $f(x,y,z)=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+{y}^{2}-{z}^{2}$, find the equation of the tangent plane to the level surface that passes through the point where $(x,y,z)=(4,-1,3).$" :question/worked-solution "The equation of the tangent plane to the level surface $f(x,y,z)=k$ at the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})$ can be expressed as\n\n$$\n∇f({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})\\cdot ⟨x-{x}_{0},\\,y-{y}_{0},\\,z-{z}_{0}⟩=0.\n$$\n\nFirst, we find the gradient of $f(x,y,z)$ and evaluate it at $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})=(4,-1,3):$  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f(x,y,z) & ={f}_{x}(x,y,z)\\,i+{f}_{y}(x,y,z)\\,j+{f}_{z}(x,y,z)\\,k \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+{y}^{2}-{z}^{2})i+\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+{y}^{2}-{z}^{2})j+\\frac{∂}{∂z}(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+{y}^{2}-{z}^{2})k \\\\  & =x\\text{ }i+2y\\text{ }j-2z\\text{ }k \\\\ ∇f(4,-1,3) & =(4)\\text{ }i+2(-1)\\text{ }j-2(3)\\text{ }k \\\\  & =4i-2j-6k \\\\  & =⟨4,\\,-2,\\,-6⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nWe can now write down the Cartesian equation of the tangent plane to the level surface, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})\\cdot ⟨x-{x}_{0},\\,y-{y}_{0},\\,z-{z}_{0}⟩ & =0 \\\\ ∇f(4,-1,3)\\cdot ⟨x-4,\\,y-(-1),\\,z-3⟩ & =0 \\\\ ⟨4,\\,-2,\\,-6⟩\\cdot ⟨x-4,\\,y+1,\\,z-3⟩ & =0 \\\\ 4(x-4)-2(y+1)-6(z-3) & =0 \\\\ 4x-2y-6z & =0 \\\\ 2x-y-3z & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-36333/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "da47f01b-0db0-586f-9d55-5bd4c952afb6"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-36333"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-80769/selection/037b9f3cb31170abc4bae536aa0d29bfe86a1f5cc839a4f3e1a6ea16f79c2bc2" :answer/id #uuid "fd00afe2-e110-52fb-bf14-71bdee67a20e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2x+8y+z-13=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80769/selection/efc5e23715db76d22e9d76430e684e0edeb65dff9a1632ddb70cde94a0fd1d4b" :answer/id #uuid "c71e8698-6189-5639-8a2b-f410ef0691d1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x+2y+z-5=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80769/selection/abb98f626b6ad6113912946af52dea3d8dd8d4a621f4ecdadcc355feb2d8e3f5" :answer/id #uuid "6febd675-c9ea-5a38-8ee0-d1fe4e0e8561" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x+4y+4z-10=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80769/selection/5bdbbf8866cb7702c83b52c144bb6b6adf6a9e2202993eb95ccea64dd2e633c4" :answer/id #uuid "05d7abcd-56c8-5843-8296-85b0d5610b87" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x+8y+4z-14=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80769/selection/56511495d48605d2d71e11c996d8ab362d454ce36584e812b07aa409a48f9936" :answer/id #uuid "1bf9813e-8ee4-5ebd-8f97-f9acce299b8d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2x+y+z-6=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80769/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "3032d5d6-32dd-59b8-9a00-eaaa947c6c33" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-80769/selection/efc5e23715db76d22e9d76430e684e0edeb65dff9a1632ddb70cde94a0fd1d4b" :answer-field/choices ["q-80769/selection/037b9f3cb31170abc4bae536aa0d29bfe86a1f5cc839a4f3e1a6ea16f79c2bc2" "q-80769/selection/efc5e23715db76d22e9d76430e684e0edeb65dff9a1632ddb70cde94a0fd1d4b" "q-80769/selection/abb98f626b6ad6113912946af52dea3d8dd8d4a621f4ecdadcc355feb2d8e3f5" "q-80769/selection/5bdbbf8866cb7702c83b52c144bb6b6adf6a9e2202993eb95ccea64dd2e633c4" "q-80769/selection/56511495d48605d2d71e11c996d8ab362d454ce36584e812b07aa409a48f9936"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-80769" :question/id #uuid "5cb3551c-b25c-5f8e-9b23-1b7b37c38a80" :question/math-academy-id "q-80769" :question/problem "Given the function $f(x,y,z)={x}^{2}+4{y}^{2}+2{z}^{2}$,  find the equation of the tangent plane to the level surface that passes through the point where $(x,y,z)=(2,1,1).$" :question/worked-solution "The equation of the tangent plane to the level surface $f(x,y,z)=k$ at the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})$ can be expressed as\n\n$$\n∇\\,f({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})\\cdot ⟨x-{x}_{0},\\,y-{y}_{0},\\,z-{z}_{0}⟩=0.\n$$\n\nFirst, we find the gradient of $f(x,y,z)$ and evaluate it at $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})=(2,1,1):$  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇\\,f(x,y,z) & ={f}_{x}(x,y,z)\\,i+{f}_{y}(x,y,z)\\,j+{f}_{z}(x,y,z)\\,k \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{2}+4{y}^{2}+2{z}^{2})\\text{ }i+\\frac{∂}{∂y}({x}^{2}+4{y}^{2}+2{z}^{2})\\text{ }j+\\frac{∂}{∂z}({x}^{2}+4{y}^{2}+2{z}^{2})\\text{ }k \\\\  & =2x\\text{ }i+8y\\text{ }j+4z\\text{ }k \\\\ ∇\\,f(2,1,1) & =2(2)\\text{ }i+8(1)j+4(1)\\text{ }k \\\\  & =4\\,i+8\\,j+4\\,k \\\\  & =⟨4,8,4⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nWe can now write down the Cartesian equation of the tangent plane to the level surface, as follows: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇\\,f({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})\\cdot ⟨x-{x}_{0},\\,y-{y}_{0},\\,z-{z}_{0}⟩ & =0 \\\\ ∇\\,f(2,1,1)\\cdot ⟨x-2,\\,y-1,\\,z-1⟩ & =0 \\\\ ⟨4,8,4⟩\\cdot ⟨x-2,\\,y-1,\\,z-1⟩ & =0 \\\\ 4(x-2)+8(y-1)+4(z-1) & =0 \\\\ 4x+8y+4z-20 & =0 \\\\ x+2y+z-5 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-80769/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "da47f01b-0db0-586f-9d55-5bd4c952afb6"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-80769"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-80764/selection/d52b788dfec053865678ee16aa2e58eb8de5d89090f203bb05dda7169da972ec" :answer/id #uuid "77641d3b-cc2a-56fe-9481-7cd3b216a068" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨3,-1,-2⟩\\cdot ⟨x+1,\\,y-1,\\,z+1⟩=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80764/selection/ea5e0fd462d6702fb9f1ad6a30a289bcf324a32d09750b01b90d5b1311e59e64" :answer/id #uuid "0a6ed4ce-7403-58b4-b3bd-33679215b6d8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨3,-1,-2⟩\\cdot ⟨x-1,\\,y+1,\\,z-1⟩=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80764/selection/3285cac2476eb5fa2cb4ad